  3460                             ; banked calls configuration
  3461                             ; MMU Next register to be used for banked calls depends on the value of CLIB_BANKING_SEGMENT:
  3462                             ;   0: MMU 0 and 1
  3463                             ;   1: MMU 2 and 3
  3464                             ;   2: MMU 4 and 5
  3465                             ;   3: MMU 6 and 7
